    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e2f83ff47b5b381891bfc55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，你今天晚点有空吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "53d3f26d4b591215b4c02cf17e887f5e9de13d125e07374d74226c2d13bf761a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:595b55f0abaee3701e5c14ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是要放水灯吧。真好，很风雅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8adf0484834291cd5bf6ae4a124bb5931220600e69ae32dc2dfab390e7a9d598",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bea0abb3ab1b25fb76eccf8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "顺着她的视线，我看到人们在和纸上画画写字，\n再将和纸跟竹签组成四方形。这是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f014e1c33f499d1bfb0e1c462faa2cb7ea454377c0ce78469490786ba7d26215",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7341ea4ca8c4888e091ebe5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f78d38cb9eb9c419482f28e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，真开心……我感觉训练员会喜欢，\n所以想说，一起来应该会很有趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53a25ad5a23bdb5499d8682324c0dd3320a9f241e5eba4e96e4e06a249b4dfad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f48abc4cc733f91259115f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30c37707ec182ea93c34b329",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好了好了，要在上面写什么心愿呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03d4a5e00cadebcd7b3bc5a0fbbe9cb53cf81b312db1739b6c8d1741618ba84a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57268957f7a9fa123bedb9c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，那就这么做吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "249199d66c3a1260a47f9941acc72b41f74dab6e1816fddaeb141c9ea521e4a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68474e15b4020346e86c1df6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:751165dea97d9e6aafaf23fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，这种的是不是别说出来比较好？\n据说这样愿望才会实现对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "89e4d0059c8b3d5933e24da8a7af84be5eb2fdb7c86cf5e6f45341a0d19d0a5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e9e2e80e64e6ca8b6badae1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "握着毛笔想着要许下什么心愿时──\n脑中自然地浮现出，过去与奇锐骏度过的每一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ab8bbb1e173c9407493f228e9ceb29dcb8596ec241b186819d0c1dc714667ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9328d04bbe4e716ab66bcb0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在我钻牛角尖，想放弃训练员这条路时，\n和奇锐骏相遇的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0537c7b2d7da82e41f06052a343c037838294fef407752de6cb826fc145aed0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81aca911c6f54cbcea75940c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多次受到她的鼓励，大受感动的事。\n内心被她的专心致志与韧性所激励的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63b241caec1bbf3dbd3dfc1c09424fcd6a7cb892cb7b07d2bea2907528a281f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2eeea5171fe9a988545bcb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（好，决定了）",
      "source_fingerprint": "73c10c293df7e9a8fe57f125ed32d9f62534969405b821544434147612b63a7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5c958ed5a75acf72cc63e1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还有，正式成为了她的训练员，\n发自内心感到欣喜的事。所以，我要和这样的她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a52bb7ad779c656ea0e8eb3282c8021b0db2c1b19ef6178c78c84df9754157e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd5fe46345f616f72989d0f3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我觉得自己已经把当下最真诚的心意写在水灯上了。\n然后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "399370dbcc3e9e95eb9695bcff8670f882ddeb44bac52609cfb3ba64166c71d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0e868b8082130f89764a115",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c0af8368b3a8da2adba5e1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……哎呀？刚才看见萤火虫了呢。这附近水流似乎比较缓和。\n训练员，我们就挑这里吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1ddc6b2316fac0d9b2d832e53a27e729f2e508c46042a538818919ac5063396",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0741ae4782de98893c1ff893",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然好",
      "source_fingerprint": "98b9cf6d7772ba8f44c1d133a4139eb62f13e423d41e3f0d8c2422f6b2e5b7a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c537213c61ce79a46e7b7708",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bebfcc9d54682a6f83299b74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有个地方，我想跟训练员两个人去一趟。\n你愿意的话，要不要一起呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cac5be40875e1475a055671a79f2a1546668afc949393c217d06294c2addadf6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c754ea0552999a0a73fb2a6a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "已有许多水灯浮现在夜晚的黑暗中。\n它们静谧地随着水面晃荡漂流着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f4f57d0e8b392648394af96b0bdf653da6c908610560d4f3a6cdc51361adf8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3573487ae067537f0a91b3a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "a207abcfd80fb4fb6f8d31f126614b1c06f6c929c600c2ce53b7c13145067eb1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1100/storytimeline_041100007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4610307c76fb7c2d7f8b12e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那我们开始放水灯吧。嘿咻。",
